== SOURCE
'u:d_ouble 'u:i_nc c:B_ 5
== TITLE
Using a library function
== NOTE 'u:d_ouble
The second operand
double, quoted: passed as a value, the argument after the nearest one.
== NOTE 'u:i_nc
The first operand
Quoted functions before a function are its first arguments, the nearest first: here B inc double.
== NOTE c:B_
From the library
B, imported with the alias c: (a raised c, in the library color).
== NOTE 5
The value
B inc double 5 is inc (double 5): 11.
